  "title": "Post-run stretch routine",
  "creator": "NHS",
  "description": "Seven runner stretches from the old NHS running pages: hip flexor, thigh, hamstring, ITB, calf, lower back and buttock, each held 15 seconds per side. Best done straight after a run while the muscles are warm; pairs with any Couch to 5K session. Stretch to tightness, never to pain.",
